# rationale as the PDFs: your own image, commit only if you consider it non-confidential.
cv/*.jpg
logs/
# Personal data (private) — the public repo ships the *.example.* templates instead.
profile/profile.md
profile/projects.yaml
profile/knowledge.md
# /history conversation log (real user data — never commit this).
data/
